      "sample": "<fieldset data-content-demo=\"comments\" style=\"border:1px solid #8886;border-radius:5px;padding:12px;min-width:0\"><legend>本地操作示例</legend><header><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" color=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"3\" focusable=\"false\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 2.5L12.5 2.5A1 1 0 0 1 13.5 3.5L13.5 10A1 1 0 0 1 12.5 11L7.777 11A1 1 0 0 0 7.2625 11.1425L4.0145 13.0913A1 1 0 0 1 2.5 12.2338L2.5 3.5A1 1 0 0 1 3.5 2.5Z\"/></svg> 文件留言</header><p><label><input data-comments-visible type=\"checkbox\" checked>顯示留言面板</label></p><p data-comments-visibility>留言面板顯示中</p><label>新增留言 <select data-comment-permission><option value=\"on\">允許</option><option value=\"off\">關閉</option></select></label><p data-comments-permission>允許新增留言</p><div data-comments-panel style=\"border-top:1px solid #8886;margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px\"><p data-comment-existing><strong>小林：</strong>請確認標題。</p><label>新留言 <input data-new-comment aria-label=\"新留言\" style=\"width:160px\"></label></div><p><small>關閉新增權限不刪除已有留言；隱藏面板不變更權限。</small></p></fieldset>",
